┌ Help — qry 0.1.0 ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Global                                                                       │
│ ctrl-q               quit                                                    │
│ ctrl-z               suspend to the shell                                    │
│ F1                   show / hide the help                                    │
│ ctrl-p               command palette                                         │
│ Tab                  next pane                                               │
│ shift-Tab            previous pane                                           │
│ ctrl-n               new connection                                          │
│ ctrl-o               import connections                                      │
│ ctrl-/               show / hide the key hints                               │
│ ctrl-↑               grow the editor                                         │
│ ctrl-↓               shrink the editor                                       │
│ F11                  maximise the pane / restore                             │
│ ctrl-l               show the messages                                       │
│ Esc                  dismiss the message                                     │
│                                                                              │
│ Tree                                                                         │
│ ?                    show / hide the help                                    │
│                                                                              │
│ run:  F5 statement  F8 all  ctrl-e selection                                 │
│ results:  / search  y copy cell  Y copy row  Enter inspect value             │
│ tree:  Enter connect  Space expand  e edit  Del delete  / filter             │
